      <title>Version 3.18.2</title>
      <sparkle:version>3.18.2</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.18.2</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 12:06:06 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li><b>Liquid Glass sidebar</b> — The sidebar floats as a glass panel again, as in macOS&#x27;s own apps: the tool&#x27;s background runs underneath it, and the window buttons sit inside it with even space around them.</li>
          <li><b>An even rhythm in the icon rail</b> — Logo, rules and icons in the folded sidebar sit on one grid: centred, with the same space above and below every rule.</li>
        </ul>
      ]]></description>
