      <pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 10:49:21 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[
        <ul>
          <li><b>Test accounts without AD</b> — An admin can give an account its own password in the permissions file — for demos and testing, without a directory account or the VPN. It shows in User Admin like anyone else and can be blocked there at any time.</li>
        </ul>
